  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>It is a hydrolysis&nbsp;reaction. In this reaction first cyclo hexane cyanide forms cyclohexyl methanamide which on further hydrolysis forms cyclohexyl methanoic&nbsp;acid. In this reaction water behaves as nucleophile and attacks on electrophilic site of carbonyl group.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b82abf0c-dfd2-4476-a1c3-18f6573485e4-image.png\" style=\"width: 387px; height: 268px;\" /></p>",
